  /// Window mode options for flash assets. Applicable to the following creative types: FLASH_INPAGE, RICH_MEDIA_DISPLAY_EXPANDING, RICH_MEDIA_IM_EXPAND, RICH_MEDIA_DISPLAY_BANNER, and RICH_MEDIA_INPAGE_FLOATING.
